<title>CHINA: China Jan-March tin output down 7.28 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March tin output down 7.28 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 12,518 tonnes of tin in the first quarter, up by two percent compared with January-March last year, the Shanghai Securities News said on Friday quoting figures from the State Statistical Bureau.</p>
<p>Tin production in March was 4,920 tonnes, it said, but gave no comparative figure.</p>
</text>
